# CELL-TS-08: A read-only child with a DRC violation (its DRC result pending a stamp) under a parent; check, catchup; modify the parent; writeall force.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/scmos -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load input/parent
select top cell
expand
cellname writeable child false
drc check
drc catchup
cellname flags child
cellname list modified
box 20 0 24 4
paint metal1
writeall force
cellname flags child
cellname flags parent
